## The Belief That Changes Everything

**Healing doesn't have to be hard.**

For too long, mental health has demanded effort when people have none to give. Therapy requires showing up. Meditation requires discipline. CBT requires homework. Exercise requires getting out of bed.

But what if the most profound healing happens when you're under the covers, barely functioning, and need something that requires zero willpower?

What if safety, gentleness, and connection are enough?

