- Your team shows up
- They send you exactly what you need
- You remember you're not alone
- Your nervous system co-regulates with their support

**Evening:**
- Optional: Reflect on your day (or don't)
- See your progress: "Your HRV recovered 20% faster today than last week"
- Send support to someone else if you have capacity
- Collect karma, customize your space, feel the progress

**That's it. No daily commitment. No streaks. No guilt. Just tools when you need them, support when you can't do it alone, and proof it's working.**

